dsv41 patch 0035: prompt path of the EXL3 dense linears without three copies (bit-exact).
Base: vllm_exl3_moe/dense.py of sudoingX v1.1 and vllm/models/deepseek_v4/nvidia/ops/o_proj.py with our 0030+0032.
Only rows > 144 (exllamav3 reconstruct range) change; decode graphs and replay batches are untouched. Drops the
group-major -> token-major copy after the fused quant, the per-group fp16 copies + stack before the GEMM, and the fp32 cat.
Bit-exact against the old path (torch.equal on real TP2 shapes, 40/40 cases on GB10).
Switches: VLLM_EXL3_DENSE_PROMPT_NOCOPY=0 and VLLM_DSV41_WOA_QDQ_GROUP_MAJOR=0 restore the old path.

--- a/vllm_exl3_moe/dense.py
+++ b/vllm_exl3_moe/dense.py
@@ -49,6 +49,23 @@
 # L2 prefetch points (l2pf.py) that follow a dense module's launch at decode sizes.
